      <trans-unit id="be_groups.subgroup.role.description">
        <source>Select the building blocks this role consists of, in the order of their TSconfig precedence. Users with this role receive all permissions of the selected building blocks. Roles and classic groups cannot be added.</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="be_users.usergroup.description">
        <source>Assign roles. Building blocks are not assigned to users directly but combined in roles; assigning them here is rejected when saving.</source>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="extConf.allowClassicGroups">
        <source>Allow classic groups: groups of kind "classic" can be created and assigned to users. Switch this off after migrating to roles and building blocks to enforce the clean model. Existing assignments keep working.</source>
      </trans-unit>
